^green;+15% 일반 저항.^reset;

en:
Maximum Force Tactical Division: Organized special squad of professional police with one job: for hunt down and capture or kill murderous cyberpsychos.

^yellow;Inserted Cyberware: ^orange;+1 Mental load | +1 physical load
^green;Active Smart-Link targeting system.^reset;
^green;+15% [EWS] Accuracy Multiplier.^reset;
^green;+15% GENERAL Resistance.^reset;

